# Dataset Information

The raw dataset used for this project is the **Online Retail II** dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository.

## Source
- **Provider:** Daqing Chen / UCI Machine Learning Repository
- **Description:** Transactional data covering stock purchases from a UK-based online giftware retailer between December 2009 and December 2011.
- **Download Link:** [UCI Machine Learning Repository - Online Retail II](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/502/online+retail+ii)

## File Usage
Due to GitHub file size limits, the raw dataset is not stored directly in this repository. To reproduce the project:
1. Download the dataset from the link above.
2. Place the raw files in your local environment.
3. Run the SQL scripts in `01_sql` to clean and prepare the data.
